","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_61","text":"They take out anyone who intended to cause harm to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_62","text":"Nothing more, nothing less.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_63","text":"Some in the Outer Rim thought that","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_64","text":"when those things came barging in, the Central Government was finally taking interest in the Outer Rim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_65","text":"From the outside, it looked just like a security crackdown.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_66","text":"People started hoping maybe their living standards would improve, and they get to live like humans for once.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_67","text":"But those things don't do a damn thing other than take down whomever they deem to be a threat to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_68","text":"No matter who dies in the Outer Rim, who kills whom, or whatever else goes on,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_69","text":"if it's not deemed a threat to the Ark, they don't move an inch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_70","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_71","text":"It's very much like Enikk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_72","text":"For better or for worse, the Outer Rim can't lay a finger on the Ark anymore.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_73","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_74","text":"So what I'm saying is, there's no need to worry just because Exotic's been given more authority.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_75","text":"The Ark is safer from the Outer Rim now than it's ever been.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_76","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_77","text":"Those two will eliminate anything that poses a threat to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_78","text":"Exotic's primary goal when it comes to overseeing the Outer Rim is making sure its inhabitants aren't all slaughtered by those two.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_79","text":"While that may not sound all that terrible at first...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_80","text":"It means the Outer Rim is officially the Ark's dumping ground.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_81","text":"And there's nothing we can do about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_82","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_83","text":"... We have to do something about that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_03_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_03_84","text":"Let's go. Ephialtes isn't far from here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}